# Termux's own packages are patched to look for UPower on the session bus. Asking there
# starts this same daemon on that bus, on demand. The desktop controller runs the main
# one on the system bus, for Shell, Mission Center and anything using libupower-glib.
[D-BUS Service]
Name=org.freedesktop.UPower
Exec=@TERMUX_PREFIX@/bin/sh -c 'DBUS_SYSTEM_BUS_ADDRESS=$DBUS_STARTER_ADDRESS exec @TERMUX_PREFIX@/libexec/upowerd'
